      "title": "Cityman Limited Appoints Mrs. Vidhya K V As Company Secretary And Compliance Officer, Effective January 8, 2026",
      "body": "Cityman Limited appointed Mrs. Vidhya K V (Membership No. A35782) as Company Secretary and Compliance Officer with effect from January 8, 2026. Mrs. Vidhya K V is an Associate Member of the Institute of Company Secretaries of India and has more than 10 years of post qualification experience in corporate legal and secretarial matters. Mrs. Vidhya K V provided her consent to act as Company Secretary, Compliance Officer, and Key Managerial Personnel in a letter dated December 26, 2025. The appointment was made by the Board of Directors at their meeting held on January 8, 2026.",
